When sending data back to the stream via `send`, the active connection to the stream is canceled before sending the new data. All requests are sent as JSON `POST` requests.

Since the `useStream` hook makes a `POST` request to your application, a valid CSRF token is required. The easiest way to provide the CSRF token is to [include it via a meta tag in your application layout's head](https://laravel.com/framework/docs/12.x/csrf#csrf-x-csrf-token).

